    "body": "To: Ms Priya Nair\nFrom: Customer Service, Skyway Holidays\nSubject: Your booking SH-48213\n\nDear Ms Nair,\n\nThank you for booking the five-day Lisbon city break with us. Unfortunately, the airline has retimed your outbound flight on 12 March. It will now depart at 7.15 a.m. instead of 10.40 a.m., so you will need to be at the airport by 5.15 a.m. Your return flight is unchanged.\n\nBecause of the earlier departure, we can offer you either a full refund or a free night at the airport hotel on the evening before you fly. Please reply by 20 February to tell us which you prefer. If we do not hear from you, we will assume you wish to keep the booking and will arrange the hotel night automatically.\n\nKind regards,\nDaniel Okoro\nSkyway Holidays"
