    "body": "Brightpath Evening College: Learn something new this spring\n\nRegistration is now open for our spring term, which begins on 14 April. Choose from more than forty courses, including beginner Spanish, digital photography and first aid for the workplace. All classes are taught by experienced professionals and take place on weekday evenings, so they fit around your job.\n\nStudents who register before 31 March receive a ten per cent discount, and those who bring a friend will receive a voucher for our cafe. Fees can be paid in three monthly instalments. Anyone who is unhappy with a course may transfer to another class within the first two weeks at no cost. For a full list of courses, visit our website or call the office."
